      "writtenOn": "2021-05-02T05:39:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another out there idea, did you consider using https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/reference/drivers/index.html#c.DEVICE_DEFINE? You could set the data pointer there as the device\u0027s data and you also get an init function that can access the device and in turn the data.",
      "revId": "2deb82ba576aedea411cb24057f7a00f8d02cb1b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
